is_twitter": false, "is_admin": false, "score": 24, "suggested_sort": 0, "post_flair_class": "", "id": 8761041, "raw_content": "Every ancestor in your family mated at one exact time, for their descendents to be who they were, and for you to be who you are. One bump in the timeline and you wouldn\u2019t be \u201cyou\u201d. \n\nOne late flight, train, wagon, boat. One moment where someone listened to the wrong voice in their head. Hell, you could\u2019ve been wiped up with a wad of toilet paper and flushed.\n\nAppreciate life for what it is, however short or long it may be. You came a long way to get here.\n", "author": "MasterChief", "created": 1785737796462, "profile_picture": "CQbmRHcNTZZ0", "community": "TheDonald", "ad_tier": 2, "last_comment_author": "Moebius", "is_video": false, "video_link": "", "is_new_user": false, "domain": "", "is_crosspost": false, "preview": "", "removal_source": "", "link": "", "author_flair_class": "", "is_removed": false, "media": {"resized_resolutions": [], "blurhash": "", "full_resolution": []}, "title": "Think about what it took for you to be you", "last_comment_created": 1785740230884, "content": "<p>Every ancestor in your family mated at one exact time, for their descendents to be who they were, and for you to be who you are. One bump in the timeline and you wouldn\u2019t be \u201cyou\u201d.</p>\n<p>One late flight, train, wagon, boat. One moment where someone listened to the wrong voice in their head. Hell, you could\u2019ve been wiped up with a wad of toilet paper and flushed.</p>\n<p>Appreciate life for what it is, however short or long it may be. You came a long way to get here.</p>\n", "score_down": 0, "author_flair_text": "", "pro_tier": 0, "is_stickied": false, "is_nsfw": false, "is_deleted": false, "is_image": false, "comments": 4, "score_up": 24, "is_edited": false, "is_moderator": false, "awards": 0, "vote_state": 2, "link_metadata": {"status": 200}, "post_flair_text": "", "archive_id": ""}, {"is_locked": false, "tweet_